{"version":1,"content":"<p>英皇娛樂行政總裁兼金牌經理人霍汶希（Mani）接受人氣旅遊YouTuber托哥（Torres Pit）網上節目訪問，分享旅行心得，並細談與藝人外出工作的趣事。</p><p>她表示，無論與家人出遊或出外公幹，往往都需要照顧一行多人的安排，因此習慣提前規劃行程，盡量避免出現計劃以外的狀况。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:41:35.231818+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:19:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T13:17:43.386024+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:45.641510+00:00","content_hash":"18fbfca8acf301a734537c54b0acc0c12b682b1a2fb3d48983015b61d97ec291","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}